<i>We will never bow under the sky</i>

320
00:21:39,665 --> 00:21:40,985
<i>Raise your hand</i>

321
00:21:41,065 --> 00:21:42,665
<i>Passion</i>

322
00:21:42,745 --> 00:21:47,145
<i>Fighting for the glory of the team</i>

323
00:21:47,665 --> 00:21:48,985
<i>Raise your hand</i>

324
00:21:49,065 --> 00:21:50,425
<i>Power</i>

325
