373
00:25:03,585 --> 00:25:04,745
Oh, it's you.

374
00:25:05,505 --> 00:25:07,425
He might look fragile,

375
00:25:07,505 --> 00:25:09,825
but he can man up if need be.

376
00:25:09,905 --> 00:25:12,745
He risked his life

377
00:25:12,825 --> 00:25:15,105
