388
00:25:43,825 --> 00:25:44,985
Yes.

389
00:25:45,665 --> 00:25:47,985
Madam Wang. Calm down now.

390
00:25:48,065 --> 00:25:50,305
Han Zi'ang encountered a traumatic event.

391
00:25:50,385 --> 00:25:52,265
His mind and his body
need time to recover.

392
00:25:53,305 --> 00:25:55,265
We're running out of time, Officer He.

393
00:25:55,345 --> 00:25:57,225
The school called me.

394
00:25:57,305 --> 00:25:59,945
They will release
his expulsion notice tomorrow.

395
00:26:00,545 --> 00:26:02,225
-Officer He. I'm begging you.
-Please.

396
00:26:02,305 --> 00:26:04,625
Get up now. I'll call the principal now.

397
00:26:15,625 --> 00:26:18,185
<i>Yesterday, several parents</i>
<i>escalated the issue to the board meeting.</i>

398
00:26:18,265 --> 00:26:20,185
<i>The school is under immense pressure.</i>

399
00:26:20,265 --> 00:26:22,865
<i>Besides, the police didn't make</i>
<i>any meaningful progress.</i>

400
00:26:22,945 --> 00:26:25,265
Principal Qin, I understand
the difficulty of your position.

401
00:26:25,345 --> 00:26:26,265
Han Zi'ang just woke up now.

402
00:26:26,945 --> 00:26:28,465
I will uncover the truth
as soon as possible.

403
00:26:28,545 --> 00:26:30,785
Then, the criminal department
will release a statement.

404
00:26:31,385 --> 00:26:33,065
<i>Officer He, can you give me a deadline?</i>

405
00:26:33,145 --> 00:26:34,025
<i>Not too long.</i>

406
00:26:34,105 --> 00:26:36,545
<i>I need to justify myself</i>
<i>before the board and the parents.</i>

407
00:26:37,065 --> 00:26:38,905
Seven days. Just seven days.

408
00:27:00,985 --> 00:27:02,545
Mister. Hello.

409
00:27:02,625 --> 00:27:04,065
Have you seen the child in this photo?

410
00:27:04,145 --> 00:27:05,345
No.

411
00:27:07,225 --> 00:27:08,145
Hi, mister.

412
00:27:08,225 --> 00:27:09,865
Have you seen the child in this photo?

413
00:27:09,945 --> 00:27:10,865
Not at all.

414
00:27:10,945 --> 00:27:12,105
Hi.

415
00:27:12,185 --> 00:27:13,745
Have you seen this child?

416
00:27:13,825 --> 00:27:14,665
No.

417
00:27:14,745 --> 00:27:16,705
Hi. Have you seen this child?

418
00:27:16,785 --> 00:27:17,625
No.

419
00:27:22,705 --> 00:27:23,865
Mr. He.

420
00:27:28,425 --> 00:27:29,545
Qiao.

421
00:27:29,625 --> 00:27:30,545
What are you doing here?

422
00:27:31,225 --> 00:27:32,505
I'm here to see a doctor.

423
00:27:32,585 --> 00:27:34,745
How do you feel now?

424
00:27:37,905 --> 00:27:40,105
You introduced the doctor to Xiaohe?

425
00:27:40,185 --> 00:27:42,185
She could've told me earlier.

426
00:27:44,905 --> 00:27:46,145
Wait.

427
00:27:46,225 --> 00:27:48,945
You're still so young.
What are you doing here?

428
00:27:49,025 --> 00:27:51,265
I'm working for the Redevelopment Bureau,

429
00:27:51,345 --> 00:27:53,545
and I have to talk to residents
who refuse to move.

430
00:27:53,625 --> 00:27:55,145
It's stressful.

431
00:27:55,225 --> 00:27:56,585
I have no one to talk to,

432
00:27:56,665 --> 00:27:59,025
so I come here to talk to my therapist.

433
00:27:59,105 --> 00:28:03,305
Have you not found a partner
after all these years?

434
00:28:04,865 --> 00:28:06,025
I'm not in a rush.

435
00:28:07,505 --> 00:28:09,505
Having a partner is nice,

436
00:28:09,585 --> 00:28:12,345
but I can't find anyone as sweet

437
00:28:14,385 --> 00:28:16,345
as Ran anymore.

438
00:28:19,665 --> 00:28:20,505
Qiao.

439
00:28:22,065 --> 00:28:24,465
We can't just live in the past.

440
00:28:25,505 --> 00:28:27,145
We have to move on.

441
00:28:37,945 --> 00:28:40,265
Officer Ran. Sorry for the long wait.

442
00:28:41,225 --> 00:28:42,265
I have the name list

443
00:28:42,345 --> 00:28:43,905
of all residents who lived
in New York Block in 1997.

444
00:28:43,985 --> 00:28:45,585
-Take a look.
-Thank you so much, Ma Qiang.

445
00:28:45,665 --> 00:28:48,345
Don't mention it.
Let me know if you need help.

446
00:28:52,265 --> 00:28:53,905
1997 YUANLONGLI HOUSEOWNERS
TENANTS REGISTRATION FORM

447
00:29:13,385 --> 00:29:14,425
Officer Ran.

448
00:29:39,705 --> 00:29:41,065
After I entered through the gate,

449
00:29:41,145 --> 00:29:43,665
I saw a familiar silhouette
and thought it was you.

450
00:29:43,745 --> 00:29:44,745
Turns out I am right.

451
00:29:47,065 --> 00:29:48,025
It's been so long.

452
00:29:48,945 --> 00:29:50,625
How have you been?

453
