458
00:30:03,065 --> 00:30:06,185
I am now interning
in an insurance company.

459
00:30:10,425 --> 00:30:12,385
You encouraged me

460
00:30:12,465 --> 00:30:15,065
to be more confident
and to make more friends.

461
00:30:16,185 --> 00:30:18,185
And I did make more friends

462
00:30:18,265 --> 00:30:20,585
and met my neighbors.

463
00:30:20,665 --> 00:30:24,025
The rumors about me have stopped.

464
00:30:27,345 --> 00:30:28,465
That's great.

465
00:30:30,585 --> 00:30:31,425
Thank you.

466
00:30:34,865 --> 00:30:36,345
You… You're injured.

467
00:30:37,065 --> 00:30:38,265
You didn't even treat your injuries.

468
00:30:39,385 --> 00:30:40,665
Just some cuts. It's nothing.

469
00:30:40,745 --> 00:30:41,785
That's no good.

470
00:30:52,225 --> 00:30:53,625
CASUAL SNEAKERS

471
00:30:54,465 --> 00:30:56,305
You're being reckless.

472
00:30:56,385 --> 00:30:58,185
Wounds are no joking matter.

473
00:31:08,465 --> 00:31:09,305
Come.

474
00:31:53,065 --> 00:31:53,985
Do you remember?

475
00:31:54,065 --> 00:31:55,905
When we first met,

476
00:31:55,985 --> 00:31:58,185
it was you who treated my wounds.

477
00:31:58,785 --> 00:31:59,625
Yes.

478
00:32:00,785 --> 00:32:02,625
I was quite clumsy back then.

479
00:32:02,705 --> 00:32:04,945
Unlike you.

480
00:32:07,105 --> 00:32:08,385
Actually,

481
00:32:08,465 --> 00:32:11,385
my first job was a carer.

482
00:32:12,105 --> 00:32:13,545
I worked in this apartment.

483
00:32:13,625 --> 00:32:15,505
Ma Qiang told me before.

484
00:32:15,585 --> 00:32:18,865
You cared for an old man.

485
00:32:21,025 --> 00:32:21,865
Yes.

486
00:32:25,065 --> 00:32:26,225
Oh.

487
00:32:26,985 --> 00:32:30,905
Why did you come to Weiyang
from Guangxi? For work?

488
00:32:32,985 --> 00:32:36,865
When I was little, my parents split up.

489
00:32:37,585 --> 00:32:39,545
My dad moved abroad with my sister,

490
00:32:39,625 --> 00:32:42,825
and I lived with my mom in Guangxi.

491
00:32:42,905 --> 00:32:45,985
But after a few years,

492
00:32:47,545 --> 00:32:51,385
my mom passed away due to an illness.

493
00:32:53,825 --> 00:32:56,945
I had learned some nursing skills
in my night school,

494
00:32:57,545 --> 00:33:00,185
so I asked my relatives to get me a job.

495
00:33:00,265 --> 00:33:02,025
That was how I came to Yuanlongli.

496
00:33:02,625 --> 00:33:05,665
When the old man
passed away due to an accident,

497
00:33:06,265 --> 00:33:07,945
I had nowhere else to go.

498
00:33:08,025 --> 00:33:09,905
So, I continued to rent this place.

499
00:33:13,745 --> 00:33:16,585
It must have been tough on you
surviving on your own.

500
00:33:17,745 --> 00:33:20,185
But no need to carry everything
on your shoulders.

501
00:33:20,265 --> 00:33:21,625
If you need help,

502
00:33:23,065 --> 00:33:24,545
just come to me.

503
00:33:26,785 --> 00:33:28,065
Don't worry.

504
00:33:28,145 --> 00:33:30,345
The toughest part has already passed.

505
00:33:31,545 --> 00:33:33,385
I'm seeing the silver lining now.

506
00:33:37,905 --> 00:33:39,185
But…

507
00:33:42,545 --> 00:33:43,465
Yes?

508
00:33:43,545 --> 00:33:46,105
DAJIANCHANG NEIGHBORHOOD

509
00:35:44,305 --> 00:35:46,265
After the incident on the rooftop,

510
00:35:46,345 --> 00:35:49,865
I always feel that someone
is staring at me at midnight.

511
00:35:50,465 --> 00:35:51,825
It's creepy.

512
00:36:08,825 --> 00:36:10,785
Qiao. If you run into trouble,

513
00:36:10,865 --> 00:36:12,065
