517
00:36:23,585 --> 00:36:24,625
Qing.

518
00:36:29,585 --> 00:36:32,025
Qing. A thief broke in again.

519
00:36:32,105 --> 00:36:33,065
What about your place?

520
00:36:33,145 --> 00:36:35,585
-Exactly. Did you lose anything?
-That guy again?

521
00:36:35,665 --> 00:36:36,945
