Oh, your hidden boyfriend.

524
00:36:44,745 --> 00:36:46,185
Why didn't you tell us?

525
00:36:46,265 --> 00:36:47,905
No. Don't say that.

526
00:36:47,985 --> 00:36:51,225
This is Ran Fangxu. Officer Ran.
He's here to investigate.

527
00:36:52,425 --> 00:36:55,425
Mr. Officer, there's a pervert
in this building.

528
00:36:56,065 --> 00:36:56,985
We live in Unit 1713.

529
00:36:57,065 --> 00:36:58,745
Our clothes that we hung to dry

530
