538
00:37:17,105 --> 00:37:18,345
-Yes. We know.
-That's right.

539
00:37:41,825 --> 00:37:42,745
Speak.

540
00:37:43,345 --> 00:37:44,825
Why do you stare at the unit
belonging to the Xus?

541
00:37:45,465 --> 00:37:47,625
I… No, I didn't do that.

542
00:37:47,705 --> 00:37:48,865
I didn't do that.

543
00:37:48,945 --> 00:37:49,985
You didn't?

544
00:37:50,745 --> 00:37:52,105
Let's speak at the police station then.

545
00:37:52,185 --> 00:37:53,025
Come.

546
00:37:54,625 --> 00:37:56,225
