562
00:38:39,585 --> 00:38:42,025
I don't know his name.

563
00:38:42,105 --> 00:38:44,545
He looked like he was around 25 years old.

564
00:38:44,625 --> 00:38:47,065
He was tall and bespectacled.

565
00:38:47,145 --> 00:38:49,865
He had a 30/70 side part,
and he looked like a gentleman.

566
00:39:32,065 --> 00:39:33,785
What a jerk.

567
00:39:33,865 --> 00:39:36,185
